  "updated_at": "2026-03-13",
  "bio": "Erika Kisler is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Munich, Germany, specializing in dotwork and fineline tattoos. Her work is renowned for its precision and attention to detail, making her a sought-after artist for anyone looking for intricate designs. Erika's portfolio, displayed at Black Heart Munich and Von Fischern und Halunken in Weilheim, showcases the exceptional quality of her artistry and technique.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Munich, Bavaria, Germany"
}